Dia keluar dari liga saya.

789
00:44:28.791 --> 00:44:30.251
[Wooju] Yoo Meri.

790
00:44:35.214 --> 00:44:36.757
[♪ tegang, muzik dramatik dimainkan]

791
00:44:37.758 --> 00:44:38.759
Kim Wooju.

792
